          "content": "The execution failed because the risk tier replacement did not match the expected format in the HWPX XML content. \n\nTrace analysis:\n- Expected: `High (즉시조치)`\n- Actual: The XML content did not contain this string after replacement.\n- Test Error: `assert 'High (즉시조치)' in '<?xml...<hp:t>비고: 사진 부록은 별도 보관</hp:t>...'`\n\nThe Executor likely performed a literal replacement or failed to account for how HWPX (Hancom Office) splits text into multiple `<hp:run>` or `<hp:t>` tags, or there was a spacing discrepancy between the risk value and the severity note (e.g., `High즉시조치` vs `High (즉시조치)`). The instructions required 'High -> 즉시조치' but the test suite expects 'High (즉시조치)'.",
